gnostic\">Book a 30-min diagnostic &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ccard\">\n      <h3>Talk to Will</h3>\n      <p>Prefer to start with a conversation? Book time directly with founder Will Sullivan &mdash; a former PwC M&amp;A advisor.</p>\n      <a class=\"clink\" href=\"https://calendly.com/pacerai/strategy-session\">Schedule a founder call &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ccard\">\n      <h3>Email us</h3>\n      <p>Have a question or a portfolio-wide deployment in mind? Reach us directly &mdash; we typically reply within one business day.</p>\n      <a class=\"clink\" href=\"mailto:will@getpacerai.com\">will@getpacerai.com</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ccard\">\n      <h3>Connect on LinkedIn</h3>\n      <p>Follow the build and reach out to Will directly on LinkedIn.</p>\n      <a class=\"clink\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/will-sullivan98/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.98 3.5C4.98 4.88 3.87 6 2.5 6S0 4.88 0 3.5 1.12 1 2.5 1s2.48 1.12 2.48 2.5zM.02 8.25H4.9V24H.02V8.25zM8.34 8.25h4.67v2.15h.07c.65-1.23 2.24-2.53 4.61-2.53 4.93 0 5.84 3.24 5.84 7.46V24h-4.87v-6.98c0-1.66-.03-3.8-2.32-3.8-2.32 0-2.68 1.81-2.68 3.68V24H8.34V8.25z\"/></svg>Connect with Will</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"footer-top\">\n    <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav-logo\" style=\"font-size:17px\">Pacer <span style=\"color:var(--teal)\">AI</span>\n        <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3 L10 9 L3 15\"/><path d=\"M15 3 L22 9 L15 15\"/><path d=\"M27 3 L34 9 L27 15\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <p>The GTM Financial Modeling Agent for Sales Leaders. Reconciled to Finance, built on Microsoft Fabric.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <div class=\"footer-col-head\">Product</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"/#revenue-modeling-agent\">Revenue Modeling Agent</a></li>\n        <li><