{display:none}\n  #pacerai-homepage .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  #pacerai-homepage .footer-top{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}\n}\n#pacerai-homepage h1,#pacerai-homepage h2,#pacerai-homepage h3,#pacerai-homepage h4,#pacerai-homepage h5,#pacerai-homepage .nav-logo{font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif !important}\n</style>\n\n<div id=\"pacerai-homepage\">\n<nav>\n  <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav-logo\">Pacer <span>AI</span>\n    <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3 L10 9 L3 15\"/><path d=\"M15 3 L22 9 L15 15\"/><path d=\"M27 3 L34 9 L27 15\"/></svg>\n  </a>\n  <ul class=\"nav-links\">\n    <li><a href=\"/#revenue-modeling-agent\">Revenue Modeling Agent</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/#use-cases\">Use Cases</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/#team\">Team</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/#pricing\">Pricing</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a></li>\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"nav-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://app.getpacerai.com/.auth/login/aad\" class=\"btn-login\">Log In</a>\n    <a href=\"https://calendly.com/pacerai/diagnostic\" class=\"btn-cta\">Free Diagnostic</a>\n    <button class=\"mobile-menu-btn\" aria-label=\"Menu\" onclick=\"this.closest('nav').classList.toggle('nav-open')\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"kick\">Contact</div>\n  <h1>Let&rsquo;s talk.</h1>\n  <p>Whether you want a live diagnostic, a founder-to-founder conversation, or just have a question about building your revenue model &mdash; here&rsquo;s how to reach us.</p>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"contact-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"contact-grid\">\n    <div class=\"ccard primary\">\n      <h3>Book a Free Diagnostic</h3>\n      <p>The fastest way in. Pick a time and we&rsquo;ll walk your revenue data through the GTM Financial Modeling Agent live &mdash; no slides.</p>\n      <a class=\"clink\" href=\"https://calendly.com/pacerai/diagnostic\">Book a 30-min diagnostic &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ccard\">\n      <h3>Talk to Will</h3>\n      <p>Prefer to start with a conversation? Book time directly with founder Will Sullivan &mdash; a former PwC M&amp;A advisor.</p>\n      <a class=\"clink\" href=\"https://calendly.com/pacerai/strategy-session\">Schedule a founder call &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ccard\">\n      <h3>Email us</h3>\n      <p>Have a question or a portfolio-wide deployment in mind? Reach us directly &mdash; we typically reply within one business day.</p>\n      <a class=\"clink\" href=\"mailto:will@getpacerai.com\">will@getpacerai.com</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ccard\">\n      <h3>Connect on LinkedIn</h3>\n      <p>Follow the build and reach out to Will directly on LinkedIn.</p>\n      <a class=\"clink\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/will-sullivan98/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.98 3.5C4.98 4.88 3.87 6 2.5 6S0 4.88 0 3.5 1.12 1 2.5 1s2.48 1.12 2.48 2.5zM.02 8.25H4.9V24H.02V8.25zM8.34 8.25h4.67v2.15h.07c.65-1.23 2.24-2.53 4.61-2.53 4.93 0 5.84 3.24 5.84 7.46V24h-4.87v-6.98c0-1.66-.03-3.8-2.32-3.8-2.32 0-2.68 1.81-2.68 3.68V24H8.34V8.25z\"/></svg>Connect with Will</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"footer-top\">\n    <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav-logo\" style=\"font-size:17px\">Pacer <span style=\"color:var(--teal)\">AI</span>\n        <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3 L10 9 L3 15\"/><path d=\"M15 3 L22 9 L15 15\"/><path d=\"M27 3 L34 9 L27 15\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <p>The GTM Financial Modeling Agent for Sales Leaders. Reconciled to Finance, built on Microsoft Fabric.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <div class=\"footer-col-head\">Product</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"/#revenue-modeling-agent\">Revenue Modeling Agent</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/#how-it-works\">How It Works</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/#integrations\">Integrations</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/#security\">Security</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <div class=\"footer-col-head\">Use Cases</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"/#gtm-planning\">GTM Planning</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/#arr-waterfall-modeling\">ARR Waterfall Modeling</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/#case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/#pricing\">Pricing</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-col\">\n      <div class=\"footer-col-head\">Resources</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/getpacerai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LinkedIn</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://app.getpacerai.com/.auth/login/aad\">Log In</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n</div>\n",
